{"id":"n17608-4-6","stage":1,"title":"손 · 照顾","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17608-4-6-1","ko":"너의 어린 시절은 어땠니?","zh":"你的童年是怎样的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너의","meaning":"你的","explanation":"너：你；-의 表示所属，合起来是“你的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너의","audio":"/audio/7256bdfdfb5852c2a596.mp3"}},{"text":"어린","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린","audio":"/audio/f78bf8d27dff1667b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"시절은","meaning":"时期","explanation":"시절：时期；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"1","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시절은","audio":"/audio/3f0054df7cd66204ad40.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠니","audio":"/audio/f9b9aecba7dab151c8bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8","term":"시절","zh":"时期","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3","entryId":"65302","definition":"特定的时期或时间。","pronunciation":["시절"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/09426fccc55a20a8187b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17608-4-6-2","ko":"난 시골에서 살았고 할머니 손에서 자랐어.","zh":"我住在乡下，是在奶奶的照顾下长大的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"시골에서","meaning":"乡下，农村，乡村","explanation":"시골：乡下，农村，乡村；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시골","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62488","senseId":"1","lemma":"시골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시골에서","audio":"/audio/32511fcf718bdf972470.mp3"}},{"text":"살았고","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살았고","audio":"/audio/ede87911d0b3db0be3cb.mp3"}},{"text":"할머니","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"손에서","meaning":"照料、照顾（할머니 손에서 자라다：由奶奶养大）","explanation":"손：照料、照顾（할머니 손에서 자라다：由奶奶养大）；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"4","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손에서","audio":"/audio/1236ca9d7536c75a5d58.mp3"}},{"text":"자랐어.","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랐어","audio":"/audio/3ed4a719130508282fe6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8d3efc29ac663a71","term":"시골","zh":"乡下，农村，乡村","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3","entryId":"62488","definition":"离城市较远、人口稀少且开发不充分的地区。","pronunciation":["시골"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"照料、照顾（할머니 손에서 자라다：由奶奶养大）","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"照料、照顾（할머니 손에서 자라다：由奶奶养大）","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"成长、长大","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某个环境或某人的照顾下长大；本句指由奶奶抚养长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/da86b65ad1f5be226a6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17608","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.366,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我住在乡下，是在奶奶的照顾下长大的。","你的童年是怎样的呢？","我们就简单吃点韩式小吃吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的童年是怎样的呢？","我们就简单吃点韩式小吃吧？","我住在乡下，是在奶奶的照顾下长大的。"],"answer":2}]}
